BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:National Emergency;SOS 112;;;
FN:SOS 112 - National Emergency (All India)
ORG:Government of India - ERSS
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE,PREF:112
NOTE:Single nationwide 24x7 emergency number for Police, Fire, and Ambulance across India. Works without unlocking phone or active SIM.
CATEGORIES:Emergency
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Police;SOS 100;;;
FN:SOS 100 - Police Control Room
ORG:Indian Police
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:100
NOTE:Immediate police assistance and crime reporting across India.
CATEGORIES:Emergency
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Fire Brigade;SOS 101;;;
FN:SOS 101 - Fire Department
ORG:Fire & Rescue Services
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:101
NOTE:Fire breakouts, building collapse, and emergency rescue operations.
CATEGORIES:Emergency
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Ambulance;SOS 102/108;;;
FN:SOS 108 / 102 - Ambulance Emergency
ORG:National Health Mission
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:108
TEL;TYPE=HOME,VOICE:102
NOTE:108 for critical medical emergencies & trauma response. 102 for maternity and neonatal transport.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Medical
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:RailMadad;SOS 139;;;
FN:SOS 139 - Indian Railways (RailMadad)
ORG:Ministry of Railways
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:139
NOTE:Press 3 for Security / RPF emergency escort. Press 1 for Medical emergency on board long passenger trains.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Travel
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Local Train GRP;SOS 1512;;;
FN:SOS 1512 - Mumbai Local Train GRP
ORG:Government Railway Police Maharashtra
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:1512
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE:+919594899991
NOTE:24x7 emergency helpline for Mumbai suburban local trains (Central, Western & Harbour lines). WhatsApp: 9594899991 or 9833312222.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Travel,Mumbai
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Women Distress;SOS 103;;;
FN:SOS 103 - Mumbai Women Helpline
ORG:Mumbai Police
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:103
NOTE:Specialized Mumbai Police safety helpline for women, children, and senior citizens in Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Women Safety,Mumbai
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:SHE Teams;SOS 9490616555;;;
FN:SOS SHE Teams - Hyderabad Women Safety
ORG:Telangana Police Women Safety Wing
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE,PREF:+919490616555
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:100
NOTE:Telangana Police SHE Teams for stalking, harassment in public/cabs, and transit emergencies. State WhatsApp: 8712656856.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Women Safety,Hyderabad
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Cyber Fraud;SOS 1930;;;
FN:SOS 1930 - Cyber Crime Financial Fraud
ORG:Indian Cyber Crime Coordination Centre (I4C)
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:1030
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE:1930
NOTE:National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal. Report online banking and UPI fraud immediately within the golden hour to freeze stolen funds.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Finance
END:VCARD

BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
N:Women Helpline;SOS 1091/181;;;
FN:SOS 1091 / 181 - Women Helpline National
ORG:Ministry of Women & Child Development
TEL;TYPE=WORK,VOICE:1091
TEL;TYPE=HOME,VOICE:181
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE:+917827170170
NOTE:1091 for emergency distress. 181 for domestic abuse and legal aid. National Commission for Women (NCW) 24x7: +91 7827170170.
CATEGORIES:Emergency,Women Safety
END:VCARD

